      "name": "Hibiscus Mint Yerbe Mate Kombucha",
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">\"Whether climbing a mountain or cramming for finals, our Yerba-Bucha's 200mg or organic caffeine will get you where you're going with ease. Low sugar paired with a rich blend of antioxidants and probiotics will keep you glowing no matter the time of day. Our yerbe mate, guayusa, and green coffee bean is rich in: theophylline, theobromine, L theanine. L theanine releases caffeine more gradually. This helps eliminate the spikes and drops associated with coffee consumption.\" - BNF</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">This brew takes the slightly earthy flavor of yerba mate tea and pairs it with sweet, floral hibiscus and refreshing, cool mint.</span></p>",
